<title>UK: UK farm minister Hogg to make 1530 GMT statement.</title>
<headline>UK farm minister Hogg to make 1530 GMT statement.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Agriculture Minister Douglas Hogg will make a statement to the UK parliament at 1530 GMT to answer questions about hygiene in Britain's meat industry, Speaker Betty Boothroyd's office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 7767</p>
